Vida Coffee — home\"><img src=\"/logo-horizontal.png\" alt=\"Taïga Pura Vida Coffee\" class=\"h-7 sm:h-9 object-contain brightness-0 invert\" style=\"width:auto\"/></a><nav class=\"hidden sm:flex items-center gap-8\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><a href=\"#about\" class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/60 hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-navigation-size);letter-spacing:var(--font-navigation-letter-spacing);text-transform:uppercase\">About</a><a href=\"#services\" class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/60 hover:text-[#EDD9B8] transition-colors\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-navigation);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-navigation-size);letter-spacing:var(--font-navigation-letter-spacing);text-transform:uppercase\">Services</a></nav><a href=\"#quote\" class=\"bg-[#C4622D] text-white px-5 sm:px-7 py-2 sm:py-2.5 rounded-full sweep-btn\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-button-size);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--font-button-letter-spacing);--sweep-bg:#E07832\">Get a Quote</a></header><main><section class=\"relative bg-[#2B1608] flex flex-col justify-center overflow-hidden h-[calc(100vh-60px)] sm:h-[calc(100vh-76px)]\"><img src=\"/img-cup-branded.jpg\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-[45%] object-cover object-center hidden sm:block pointer-events-none select-none\"/><div class=\"absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-[50%] hidden sm:block pointer-events-none\" style=\"background:linear-gradient(to right, #2B1608 0%, #2B1608 20%, transparent 70%)\"></div><img src=\"/logo-mark-black.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute right-4 bottom-4 brightness-0 invert pointer-events-none select-none sm:hidden\" style=\"width:38vw;opacity:0.08\"/><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full px-5 sm:px-12 page-enter\"><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase mb-5 sm:mb-6\">Charlottesville, VA · Coffee Catering</p><h1 class=\"text-[#EDD9B8] leading-none text-5xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl mb-5 sm:mb-6\">Farm-to-Cup<br/>Coffee<br/>Catering.</h1><p class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/50 text-base sm:text-lg leading-7 max-w-lg mb-7 sm:mb-8 font-light\">Specialty espresso bars, cold brew stations, and full-service coffee setups for corporate events, weddings, and celebrations.</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3 sm:gap-4\"><a href=\"#quote\" class=\"bg-[#C4622D] text-white px-7 sm:px-9 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-full sweep-btn\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-button-size);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--font-button-letter-spacing);--sweep-bg:#E07832\">Get a Quote</a><a href=\"#about\" class=\"border border-[#EDD9B8]/25 text-[#EDD9B8] px-7 sm:px-9 py-3.5 sm:py-4 rounded-full sweep-btn\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-button-size);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--font-button-letter-spacing);--sweep-bg:rgba(255,255,255,0.07)\">Our Story</a></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"bg-[#FAF6F0] py-20 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-12\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"mb-14 sm:mb-16\"><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase mb-4 sm:mb-5\">What We Offer</p><h2 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight\">Every event deserves<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/> exceptional coffee.</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-5 sm:gap-6\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-10 h-full flex flex-col\"><img src=\"/icon-latte.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain mb-5 select-none\"/><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3\">01</p><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-3\">Coffee Catering</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">From intimate office gatherings to large corporate events, we bring a full-service espresso bar, trained baristas, and specialty-grade beans — all in one booking.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-10 h-full flex flex-col\"><img src=\"/icon-iced-coffee.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain mb-5 select-none\"/><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3\">02</p><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-3\">Espresso Bar</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">Hand-crafted drinks made to order. Cortados, lattes, cappuccinos — elevated, personalized, and made with care for every guest in line.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-10 h-full flex flex-col\"><img src=\"/icon-cold-brew.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain mb-5 select-none\"/><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3\">03</p><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-3\">Cold Brew</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">Slow-steeped in-house with our Costa Rican single-origin beans. Rich, smooth, and served on tap or in bulk — perfect for warm weather events.</p></div></div><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8]/60 rounded-2xl p-7 sm:p-10 h-full flex flex-col\"><img src=\"/icon-latte.png\" alt=\"\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"w-16 h-16 object-contain mb-5 select-none\"/><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] tracking-[0.3em] uppercase mb-3\">04</p><h3 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-2xl sm:text-3xl mb-3\">Drip Coffee</h3><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-sm leading-6 font-light\">Classic, consistent, never an afterthought. Our drip service delivers quality at scale so every attendee gets a cup worth drinking.</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#FAF6F0] pb-20 sm:pb-32\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-12\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 sm:gap-4\"><img src=\"/photo-outdoor.png\" alt=\"Steaming coffee and croissant at an outdoor café table\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-position:center;max-height:320px\"/><img src=\"/photo-table.png\" alt=\"Coffee and croissant on a wooden café table\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover mt-8\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-position:center;max-height:320px\"/><img src=\"/photo-hand-latte.png\" alt=\"Hand holding a beautifully crafted latte\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover hidden sm:block\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-position:center top;max-height:320px\"/></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-[#FAF6F0] py-20 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-12\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"mb-14 sm:mb-16\"><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase mb-4 sm:mb-5\">Corporate Events</p><h2 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight\">Bring the café<br class=\"hidden sm:block\"/> to your office.</h2></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-6 gap-3 sm:gap-4\"><div class=\"reveal col-span-6 sm:col-span-2\"><img src=\"/photo-cart-front.jpg\" alt=\"Taïga branded coffee cart with La Marzocco espresso machine at a corporate venue\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-position:center;max-height:400px\"/></div><div class=\"reveal col-span-6 sm:col-span-2\"><img src=\"/photo-espresso-pull.jpg\" alt=\"Espresso being pulled into a Taïga branded cup\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover sm:mt-10\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-position:center;max-height:400px\"/></div><div class=\"reveal col-span-6 sm:col-span-2\"><img src=\"/photo-barista-cart.jpg\" alt=\"Taïga barista preparing drinks at the coffee cart\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:3/4;object-position:center top;max-height:400px\"/></div><div class=\"reveal col-span-6 sm:col-span-3\"><img src=\"/photo-service-moment.jpg\" alt=\"Barista handing a Taïga cup to a guest at a corporate event\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-position:center;max-height:340px\"/></div><div class=\"reveal col-span-6 sm:col-span-3\"><img src=\"/photo-cart-wide.jpg\" alt=\"Full Taïga coffee cart setup with barista and guest at a corporate venue\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:4/3;object-position:center;max-height:340px\"/></div></div><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"mt-12 sm:mt-16 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-6\"><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/60 text-base leading-7 font-light max-w-lg\">Our mobile espresso cart arrives fully equipped — specialty-grade beans, a trained barista, and our signature La Marzocco machine. No venue sourcing, no coffee hassle, just an elevated experience for your team or guests.</p><a href=\"#quote\" class=\"shrink-0 inline-flex items-center bg-[#C4622D] text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full sweep-btn\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-button-size);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--font-button-letter-spacing);--sweep-bg:#E07832\">Get a Quote</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"bg-white py-20 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10 sm:gap-16 items-center\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase mb-6\">Our Roots</p><h2 class=\"text-[#2B1608] text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight mb-6\">Sourced from<br/>Costa Rica&#x27;s<br/>highlands.</h2><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/65 text-base leading-7 font-light mb-5\">Our beans come directly from a family-owned finca in Costa Rica&#x27;s renowned coffee-growing region — traceable, ethical, and extraordinary. What begins as a relationship between family and farmers becomes the coffee your guests remember.</p><p class=\"text-[#5C2D0E]/65 text-base leading-7 font-light mb-10\">Taïga Pura Vida Coffee brings the warmth of Costa Rican pura vida and the precision of specialty craft to Charlottesville, VA and beyond.</p><a href=\"#quote\" class=\"inline-flex items-center bg-[#2B1608] text-[#EDD9B8] px-7 py-3.5 rounded-full sweep-btn\" style=\"font-family:var(--font-button);font-weight:700;font-size:var(--font-button-size);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:var(--font-button-letter-spacing);--sweep-bg:#5C2D0E\">Work With Us</a></div></div><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"relative\"><img src=\"/img-lifestyle-mountains.jpg\" alt=\"Taïga iced drink held up against the Blue Ridge mountains\" class=\"rounded-2xl w-full object-cover object-top\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1/1;max-height:480px\"/><img src=\"/img-kids-cups.jpg\" alt=\"Community enjoying Taïga coffee\" class=\"absolute -bottom-6 -left-4 sm:-left-8 w-2/5 rounded-xl object-cover border-4 border-white shadow-lg\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1\"/></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"quote\" class=\"bg-[#2B1608] py-20 sm:py-32\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 sm:px-12\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-10 sm:gap-16 items-start\"><div class=\"reveal \"><div><p class=\"text-[#C4622D] text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.35em] uppercase mb-6\">Get a Quote</p><h2 class=\"text-[#EDD9B8] text-4xl sm:text-5xl leading-tight mb-5\">Let&#x27;s plan<br/>your event.</h2><p class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/45 text-base leading-7 font-light mb-10\">Tell us about your event and we&#x27;ll respond within 24 hours with a custom quote.</p><ul class=\"space-y-3.5\"><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C4622D] shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/55 text-sm font-light\">Weddings &amp; private celebrations</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C4622D] shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/55 text-sm font-light\">Corporate events &amp; office setups</span></li><li class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C4622D] shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-[#EDD9B8]/55 text-sm font-light\">Markets, pop-ups &amp; festivals</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"reveal \"><div class=\"bg-[#FAF6F0] rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8\"><form class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-[#2B1608]/50 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1.5\">Name *</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"w-full bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-[#2B1608] text-sm placeholder:text-[#2B1608]/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#C4622D] transition-colors\" placeholder=\"Jane Smith\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-[#2B1608]/50 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1.5\">Email *</label><input type=\"email\" class=\"w-full bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-[#2B1608] text-sm placeholder:text-[#2B1608]/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#C4622D] transition-colors\" placeholder=\"jane@company.com\" required=\"\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4\"><div><label class=\"block text-[#2B1608]/50 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1.5\">Phone</label><input type=\"tel\" class=\"w-full bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-[#2B1608] text-sm placeholder:text-[#2B1608]/30 focus:outline-none focus:border-[#C4622D] transition-colors\" placeholder=\"(555) 000-0000\" value=\"\"/></div><div><label class=\"block text-[#2B1608]/50 text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-1.5\">Event Type *</label><select class=\"w-full bg-white border border-[#EDD9B8] rounded-xl px-4 py-3 text-[#2B1608] text-s